\ lib/joy.ir4 - Portable joystick / gamepad input API (optional override per platform)
\ Bitmask returned by joyread:
\   1 = Up, 2 = Down, 4 = Left, 8 = Right, 16 = Fire/Btn1, 32 = Btn2, 64 = Select, 128 = Start

\ Query number of joystick/gamepad ports (0 = joystick input unsupported)
default fn joycount ( -> :i ) 0 end

\ Read current button bitmask for *port* (0-based; returns 0 if unsupported or out of range)
default fn joyread ( port :i -> :i ) port drop 0 end
